      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "La siguiente consulta SQL te permitirá obtener las marcas comerciales (\"brand names\") relacionadas con los Concept IDs de medicamentos que has proporcionado (1516830 y 19046168). La consulta une las tablas `concept` y `concept_relationship` para identificar las relaciones de tipo 'RxNorm has brand name' y luego recupera los detalles de los conceptos de marca.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n  c1.concept_id AS medication_concept_id,\n  c1.concept_name AS medication_name,\n  c2.concept_id AS brand_concept_id,\n  c2.concept_name AS brand_name,\n  c2.vocabulary_id AS brand_vocabulary,\n  c2.domain_id AS brand_domain\nFROM\n  `concept` AS c1\nJOIN\n  `concept_relationship` AS cr\nON\n  c1.concept_id = cr.concept_id_1\nJOIN\n  `concept` AS c2\nON\n  cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nWHERE\n  c1.concept_id IN (1516830, 19046168)\n  AND cr.relationship_id = '44818789' -- 'RxNorm has brand name'\n  AND c2.standard_concept = 'S'\n  AND c2.invalid_reason IS NULL\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnYBjz1rX-xeXUk05I23QQ4mTv0L0pXwGPTmD5YziRmRik46Dw0TQBVM1asu3qPAoW602R4SO-hUJQf0yjA49vf_Fis50RWYvrt071_1uuvudBfGRl6bX1YSgqEDI6WnppcE2Kp5cz3t0u6xWIDFt3N2qpSuMjjK"
